{
  "id": "975",
  "title": "A Snack at the Dragon Boat Festival",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-06-23",
  "synopsis": "Do you know how to eat zongzi?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/975/01a041b16349ac45a7e8fe8becffc33389635b9b.mp3?1592124087",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "端午节的点心\n\n    中国人喜欢在端午节吃粽子。中国人吃粽子时，会拿开粽子叶，吃里面的粽子。\n    今天是端午节，学校给留学生们发了粽子。\n    第二天，一名大一的留学生对老师说：“你们发的点心很好吃，谢谢！就是外面的生菜有点硬。”",
    "traditional": "端午節的點心\n\n    中國人喜歡在端午節吃粽子。中國人吃粽子時，會拿開粽子葉，吃裡面的粽子。\n    今天是端午節，學校給留學生們發了粽子。\n    第二天，一名大一的留學生對老師說：“你們發的點心很好吃，謝謝！就是外面的生菜有點硬。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "A Snack at the Dragon Boat Festival"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "中国人喜欢在端午节吃粽子。",
      "traditional": "中國人喜歡在端午節吃粽子。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó rén xǐ huan zài duān wǔ jié chī zòng zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "中国人吃粽子时，会拿开粽子叶，吃里面的粽子。",
      "traditional": "中國人吃粽子時，會拿開粽子葉，吃裡面的粽子。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó rén chī zòng zi shí huì ná kāi zòng zi yè chī lǐ miàn de zòng zi",
      "english": "Chinese people like to eat zongzi during the Dragon Boat Festival."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When Chinese people eat zongzi, they will open up the leaves and eat the glutinous rice with filling inside."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "今天是端午节，学校给留学生们发了粽子。",
      "traditional": "今天是端午節，學校給留學生們發了粽子。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì duān wǔ jié xué xiào gěi liú xué shēng men fā le zòng zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today is the Dragon Boat Festival. The school gave the international students filled glutinous rice wrapped in leaves."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "第二天，一名大一的留学生对老师说：",
      "traditional": "第二天，一名大一的留學生對老師說：",
      "pinyin": "dì èr tiān yì míng dà yī de liú xué shēng duì lǎo shī shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“你们发的点心很好吃，谢谢！就是外面的生菜有点硬。”",
      "traditional": "“你們發的點心很好吃，謝謝！就是外面的生菜有點硬。”",
      "pinyin": "nǐ men fā de diǎn xin hěn hǎo chī xiè xie jiù shì wài miàn de shēng cài yǒu diǎn yìng",
      "english": "On the second day, a first-year international student said to the teacher:"
    }
  ],
